{"sections":[{"slug":"预层范畴之间的伴随","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"预层范畴之间的伴随"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴之间的伴随</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/范畴论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"预层范畴之间的伴随"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴之间的伴随是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中十分常见的一种现象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">指的是范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$, $\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的函子诱导的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {\\mathcal C} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}),\\widehat {\\mathcal D} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的伴随</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当然</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中也有相应的现象</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴之间的伴随是是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的特例</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而数学中的许多现象又是它的特例</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {\\mathcal C} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}),\\widehat {\\mathcal D} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的伴随</span>\n$$\r\nf_! \\dashv f^* \\dashv f_*,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$f^*\\colon \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}) \\to \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ <span lang=\"zh\">是预层的拉回</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">函子的复合</span>),$$\r\n  (f^* X)(c) = X(f(c)).\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">拉回的左伴随</span> $f_!$ <span lang=\"zh\">是沿</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":",$$\r\n  (f_! X)(d) = \\operatorname{colim}_{d\\to f(c)} X(c).\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">拉回的右伴随</span> $f_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">是沿</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":",$$\r\n  (f_* X)(d) = \\operatorname{lim}_{f(c)\\to d} X(c).\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张可视为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的复合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张可视为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的同态集</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若将</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\widetilde f\\colon \\mathcal C\\times\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathsf{Set},\\,\r\n(c,d)\\mapsto\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(d,f(c)),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">那么两者的复合为</span>\n$F\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}\\widetilde f \\colon \\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$,\n$$\r\nd\\mapsto\\operatorname{colim}_{c}\r\nF(c)\\times\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(d,f(c)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">若将</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\bar f\\colon \\mathcal D\\times\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Set},\\,\r\n(d,c)\\mapsto \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(f(c),d),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\widetilde f$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的同态集为</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $[\\bar f,F]\\colon \\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathsf{Set}$,\n$$\r\nd\\mapsto \\operatorname{lim}_{c}\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Set}}\r\n\\big({\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(f(c),d)},F(c)\\big).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">伴随诱导预层范畴之间的伴随</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$, $g\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":", $f\\dashv g$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">注意到</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Psh} = \\operatorname{Hom}((-)^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})\\colon \\mathsf{Cat}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Cat}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴之间的函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"; <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $f^*\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal D} \\to \\widehat {\\mathcal C}$, $g^*\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal C} \\to \\widehat {\\mathcal D}$ <span lang=\"zh\">也是一对伴随</span>, $f^* \\dashv g^*$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>,\n$$\r\nf^* = g_!,\\quad f_* = g^*.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这两个等价也可使用</span> $g_!$, $f_*$ <span lang=\"zh\">的具体表达式验证</span>:\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n(g_! X) (c) &amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_{c\\to g(d)} X(d) \\\\\r\n&amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_{f(c)\\to d} X(d)\\\\\r\n&amp;= X(f(c)) = (f^*X) (c),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n(f_* X) (d) &amp;= \\operatorname{lim}_{f(c)\\to d} X(c) \\\\\r\n&amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_{c\\to g(d)} X(c)\\\\\r\n&amp;= X(g(d)) = (g^*X) (d).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">总结起来</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于伴随</span> $f\\dashv g$, <span lang=\"zh\">有预层范畴之间的四元伴随</span>\n$$\r\nf_! \\dashv (f^*=g_!) \\dashv (f_*=g^*) \\dashv g_*.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">对可表函子的作用</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设函子</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/预层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">预层范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\widehat {\\mathcal C} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set}),\\widehat {\\mathcal D} = \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathcal D^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathsf{Set})$ <span lang=\"zh\">之间的伴随</span>\n$$\r\nf_! \\dashv f^* \\dashv f_*,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">则对于</span> $c\\in \\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $f_! \\mathbf{y}(c) = \\mathbf{y}(f(c))$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">先推再拉</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/全忠实函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">全忠实函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">即全子范畴的嵌入时</span>,\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nf^*f_! X (c) &amp;=\r\nf_! X(f(c))\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{f(c) \\to f(c')} X(c')\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_{c \\to c'} X(c') = X(c),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\nf^*f_* X (c) &amp;=\r\nf_* X(f(c))\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{lim}_{f(c') \\to f(c)} X(c')\\\\\r\n&amp;=\r\n\\operatorname{lim}_{c' \\to c} X(c') = X(c),\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即两个自然映射</span> $f^*f_*\\to X \\to f^*f_! X$ <span lang=\"zh\">均为同构</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}